{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110369","id":2813640319,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ntL5_","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110369","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110369.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110369.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110369","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110369/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110369/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110369/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f873fa3c3ab5618f67efd7910871e4440769f4ac","number":110369,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Display and allow setting name/index of BlendSpace points","user":{"login":"vaner-org","id":9658355,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NTgzNTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9658355?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org","html_url":"https://github.com/vaner-org","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes [#12487](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12487), closes [#4417](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/4417), closes [#66336](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/66336).\r\n\r\n~For ease of review and feedback, this PR's commits are currently separate.~ I'd like to walk through everything this commit adds, so that any additions deemed extraneous can be removed before the squash.\r\n\r\n## Allow naming points\r\n\r\nPoints can now be named, and their name will now hold their reference in code.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"900\" height=\"160\" alt=\"Allow naming points\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/db9ffe5e-d569-440e-928b-a28dd51cdb56\" />\r\n\r\n~This is not a breaking change, all index references remain valid until they are replaced with a name.~ On first launch, indices are transcribed into the string names, that can then be changed by the user.\r\n\r\n## Visible index/name\r\n\r\nIn both BlendSpace editors, the index/name is now visible above the point.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"535\" height=\"235\" alt=\"Visible indexes\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c269db39-a64b-4dd5-b57e-da2154d57eaa\" />\r\n\r\nIf this text is too close to the left/right/top edge, it automatically moves itself to fit in the visible view.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c2ec8b5b-9c4c-42f3-8c9e-6a4fa84258be\r\n\r\nThe point can also be dragged using its text.\r\n\r\n## Unique names upon creation\r\n\r\nAs mentioned in [#12487](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12487), points are now given unique names in  the same convention as BlendTree and StateMachine.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"980\" height=\"250\" alt=\"Unique names given upon creation\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/87dbcf5d-1b4f-4568-ad43-82290327c552\" />\r\n\r\n## Inline editing for names\r\n\r\nWhen a point's text is clicked and released without initiating a drag, its name can be edited inline. ~If this name is removed, the point reverts to using its index reference.  A purely numeric name results in the forced prefixing of '#'.~ If an empty name is committed, the point reverts to a name based on its node type or animation.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3de76906-13ff-4590-93f9-09d5ccac2fbf\r\n\r\n## Editing index via toolbar or scrolling directly over points\r\n\r\nIt is possible to edit the index of a point by incrementing/decrementing/specifying a new index via the toolbar, or scrolling over the points. This makes the BlendSpace editor enter a temporary state where indexes are displayed above points, rather than names. ~It is possible edit the name here too, and once again, a purely numeric name results in the forced prefixing of '#'.~\r\n\r\n<img width=\"655\" height=\"110\" alt=\"Editing index and name via toolbar\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/74f660bd-05ba-4f5f-bf61-0e5f47b1424d\" />\r\n\r\n## Consolidating point editing tools to the right side\r\n\r\nThe toolbar was moved to the right to consolidate all the \"point editing\" features to one side, to better separate the tools editing the blend space as a whole versus a blend point within it.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1198\" height=\"100\" alt=\"Consolidating point editing tools to the right side\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b79207df-b701-4ab9-a844-7a7d5fbe775e\" />\r\n\r\n~However, since the name box can likely be removed entirely thanks to the inline editing, maybe this change not needed. That being said, I do feel it helps AnimationTree usability as a whole, and can relegate it to another PR.~\r\n\r\n***\r\n\r\nThe issue this PR closes was one of the first major pain points I had with animation in Godot. However, the scope of this is beyond anything I've attempted before, so feedback is very much appreciated. I will integrate recommendations as soon as I can.\r\n\r\nWhat in my opinion needs the most rigorous testing is undo/redo, it took me a while to get it free of bugs.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.c